{"id":"a49fd95efa82785c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-mixeddigraph.md","title":"Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs","display":"df-mixeddigraph — Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-mixeddigraph","aliases":["27-df-mixeddigraph"],"display":"df-mixeddigraph — Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs","depends_on":["[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-dnf]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.1 graph model","source_statement":"Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs","source_printed_pages":"209–210","source_pdf_pages":"233–234","verification_status":"source-construction-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-mixeddigraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-mixeddigraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mixeddigraph — Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.1 graph model"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a49fd95efa82785c\" href=\"?note=a49fd95efa82785c\" title=\"Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs\">Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209–210"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"233–234"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i\\neq j\\}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i\\neq j\\}\\)</span>；项、文字与 DNF 求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_A\\subseteq N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Reach}_A\\subseteq N^2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a> 的 DNF 求值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_A\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_i,\\bar x_j\\}}:(i,j)\\in A\\},\\qquad f_A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_A\\coloneqq\\{T_{\\{x_i,\\bar x_j\\}}:(i,j)\\in A\\},\\qquad f_A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_A(i,j)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in N^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;(v_0=i\\land v_r=j\\land\\forall t\\in\\{s\\in\\mathbb N\\mid s&lt;r\\}\\;((v_t,v_{t+1})\\in A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Reach}_A(i,j)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in N^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;(v_0=i\\land v_r=j\\land\\forall t\\in\\{s\\in\\mathbb N\\mid s&lt;r\\}\\;((v_t,v_{t+1})\\in A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^*\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i\\neq j\\land\\mathrm{Reach}_A(i,j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^*\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i\\neq j\\land\\mathrm{Reach}_A(i,j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有向边 i→j 表示违例项 x_i ¬x_j。对角路径在 A* 中排除，避免把恒假项 x_i ¬x_i 当成非零项；该选择不影响不同顶点间的闭包等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"Mixed quadratic functions represented by directed graphs","status":"resolved","id":"a49fd95efa82785c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","h