\mathbb N$。$A,B\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in[n]^2:i\\neq j\\}$；$f_A,f_B,A^*,B^*$ 见 [[27-df-mixeddigraph]]。"}],"outgoing":["e065076d6b51508e","0b618255959ff4bc"]}